    <!-- Onboarding -->
    <string name="onb_step">Step %1$d of %2$d</string>
    <string name="onb1_title">AI is great. Oversharing isn’t.</string>
    <string name="onb1_sub">Airlock lets you ask the smartest AI about private things, while the details that identify you stay on your phone.</string>
    <string name="onb1_p1_b">1. Your phone reads it first.</string>
    <string name="onb1_p1">Gemini Nano finds names, places and numbers and seals them, on this phone.</string>
    <string name="onb1_p2_b">2. Gemini gets the problem, not the person.</string>
    <string name="onb1_p2">Only the sealed version is sent, after a final check.</string>
    <string name="onb1_p3_b">3. The real names come back on your phone.</string>
    <string name="onb1_p3">Every request gets a receipt showing exactly what left.</string>
    <string name="onb1_honest">Airlock hides who you are, not what happened. Detection isn’t perfect, which is why you can review everything before it’s sent. Airlock helps you understand and prepare; it doesn’t give legal, medical or financial advice.</string>
