    <string name="settings_pref_note">Automatic answers quick tasks on this phone and sends harder ones, sealed, to Gemini. With “This phone only”, nothing is ever sent.</string>
    <string name="settings_honest_title">What Airlock does and doesn’t do</string>
    <string name="settings_honest">Airlock hides who you are, not what happened. It finds names, places, contact details and IDs on your phone and replaces them before anything is sent. Detection isn’t perfect, so you always see exactly what leaves. Airlock helps you understand and prepare; it doesn’t give legal, medical or financial advice.</string>
    <string name="settings_storage">Raw text you paste is kept encrypted on this phone for %1$d days, then deleted. Nothing is backed up or synced.</string>
    <string name="settings_mode_live">Mode: live (Firebase AI Logic — Gemini Nano on this phone, Gemini in the cloud).</string>
    <string name="settings_mode_demo">Mode: demo (scripted answers, separate storage).</string>
